test).\n- [ ] Fix lands RED->GREEN; the live-openai arm's guard passes against the current model-class config (verifiable locally by driving the guard's resolution path without live credentials).\n- [ ] Parity sweep: same guard logic for anthropic/bedrock arms checked for the same prefix fragility.","id":"cb46-6b26-b0e3-4192","parent_id":"","priority":2,"tags":[],"ticket_type":"bug","title":"openai live arm: provider guard rejects openai-chat model specs"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1787400807421332001,"uuid":"868cf0d4-1082-49c0-98f4-bf3abb763063"}